; kilim.websocket: a WebSocket as a subscription, and send and close as tasks
; with a result, above one global driver record. It uses only the standard
; library and kilim, thus Websocket_mock of kilim.testing runs as native code.
; kilim.websocket.browser (browser/) gives the driver on the WebSocket API. The
; rule of the banned modules of the core applies (test/link).

(library
 (name kilim_websocket)
 (public_name kilim.websocket)
 (libraries kilim)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
